There are {{#ask:[[TXMN Completed Exists::false]] | format=count}} uncompleted and {{#ask:[[TXMN Completed::Complete]] | format=count}} completed so far. A completed monster is one with a 64x64 pixel front sprite, a 64x64 pixel back sprite, and a two-frame animated 24x24 pixel face sprite - i.e., the requirements for appearing in the Tuxemon game. 

Tuxemon's monsters come from [[Monster Sources|a variety of different projects and contributors]].

